→0
L7:∆L7 ∆F
→0
L8:∆L8 ∆F
→0
L9:∆L9 ∆F
→0
L10:∆L10 ∆F
→0
L11:∆L11 ∆F
→0
L12:∆L12 ∆F
→0
L13:∆L13 ∆F
→0
L14:∆L14 ∆F
→0
NOTYET:'LESSON ';∆N;' IS NOT YET WRITTEN.'
→0
BAD:'THERE ARE 16 LESSONS. TYPE CONTENTS TO SEE THEM.'
∇
∇QUIZ ∆N
→((∆N<1)∨∆N>16)/BAD
→(∆N>14)/NOTYET
'QUIZ ';∆N;'. TYPE EACH ANSWER AS APL AFTER THE QUAD PROMPT.'
→(Q1,Q2,Q3,Q4,Q5,Q6,Q7,Q8,Q9,Q10,Q11,Q12,Q13,Q14)[∆N]
Q1:∆Q1
→0
Q2:∆Q2
→0
