∇∆L14 ∆F;∆Q
→(S1,S2,S3,S4)[1⌈4⌊∆F]
S1:'LESSON 14: ERRORS'
''
'AN ERROR REPORT HAS THREE LINES: THE KIND OF ERROR, THE'
'STATEMENT, AND A CARET UNDER THE POINT APL HAD REACHED WHEN'
'IT GAVE UP. APL WORKS FROM THE RIGHT, SO EVERYTHING TO THE'
'RIGHT OF THE CARET WAS DONE. TRY:'
''
'      1 2+1 2 3'
'      2÷0'
'      XYZ+1'
'      (1 2 3)[5]'
∆TRY
∆Q←∆PAUSE
→∆Q/0
S2:'THE COMMON KINDS:'
''
'   SYNTAX     THE LINE IS NOT A SENTENCE: 2+ OR ((1)'
'   VALUE      A NAME WITH NO VALUE, OR A FUNCTION WITH NONE'
'   DOMAIN     THE RIGHT SHAPE, THE WRONG KIND: 2÷0, ''A''+1'
'   LENGTH     TWO VECTORS OF DIFFERENT LENGTHS'
'   RANK       A VECTOR AGAINST A MATRIX: 1 2 3+2 2⍴1'
'   INDEX      A SUBSCRIPT PAST THE END'
''
'AT A PAUSE, OR AT THE PROMPT, AN ERROR IS REPORTED AND YOU'
'GO ON. INSIDE A FUNCTION IT IS DIFFERENT.'
∆TRY
∆Q←∆PAUSE
→∆Q/0
S3:'OOPS FAILS ON ITS SECOND LINE:'
''
'      ∇OOPS'
'[1]   ''BEFORE'''
'[2]   1 2+1 2 3'
'[3]   ''AFTER'''
'[4]   ∇'
''
'AT A PAUSE A FAILING FUNCTION IS ABANDONED FOR YOU, SINCE'
'THE PAUSE ASKS AGAIN, AND )SI AT A PAUSE SHOWS THE LESSON'
'ITSELF WAITING FOR YOU. TRY:'
''
'      OOPS'
'      )SI'
∆TRY
∆Q←∆PAUSE
→∆Q/0
S4:'AT THE PROMPT IT IS DIFFERENT. OOPS PRINTS BEFORE, THEN THE'
'REPORT WITH OOPS[2] IN FRONT OF THE STATEMENT, AND STOPS'
'THERE, SUSPENDED: ITS LOCALS ARE STILL THERE TO LOOK AT.'
')SI SHOWS IT WITH A STAR, → ALONE ABANDONS IT, AND →3 GOES'
'ON FROM LINE 3. WHEN THIS LESSON ENDS, TRY:'
''
'      OOPS'
'      )SI'
'      →3'
'      )SI'
''
'A SUSPENSION LEFT BEHIND KEEPS ITS LOCALS AND HIDES ANY'
'GLOBALS OF THE SAME NAMES. CLEAR EACH WITH → UNTIL )SI'
'PRINTS NOTHING; )SIV SHOWS WHAT NAMES EACH ONE HOLDS.'
''
'END OF LESSON 14. TYPE QUIZ 14 TO CHECK, OR NEXT TO GO ON.'
∇
∇∆Q14;∆S;∆A
∆S←0
'WHICH ERROR IS 1 2 3+4 5? TYPE ITS NAME IN QUOTES.'
∆A←∆READ
→('STOP' ∆IS ∆A)/0
∆S←∆S+'LENGTH ERROR' ∆CHECK ∆A
'WHICH ERROR IS 2÷0?'
∆A←∆READ
→('STOP' ∆IS ∆A)/0
∆S←∆S+'DOMAIN ERROR' ∆CHECK ∆A
'WHICH ERROR IS A NAME THAT HAS NO VALUE?'
∆A←∆READ
→('STOP' ∆IS ∆A)/0
∆S←∆S+'VALUE ERROR' ∆CHECK ∆A
'WHICH COMMAND LISTS THE SUSPENDED FUNCTIONS? IN QUOTES.'
∆A←∆READ
→('STOP' ∆IS ∆A)/0
∆S←∆S+')SI' ∆CHECK ∆A
'WHAT DO YOU TYPE, ALONE, TO ABANDON A SUSPENSION? IN QUOTES.'
∆A←∆READ
→('STOP' ∆IS ∆A)/0
∆S←∆S+'→' ∆CHECK ∆A
'YOU GOT ';∆S;' OF 5.'
∇
